5
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:45,400
My little ancestor is about to give birth and still dancing like this

6
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,400
be careful

7
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:55,820
Give her some magic herbs or elixirs

8
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:56,820
She will let you touch her
